// Bends in box 1, ring finger with the middle and index behind it: half steps on the wound string 3,
// whole steps on the plain string 2. Bars 1-2: each bend is followed by its target note fretted, so
// you can check the pitch. Vibrato on the long notes.
\title "Bends and vibrato in box 1"
\tempo 80
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
\staff { tabs }
\ts (4 4)
:2 7.3{lf 4 b (0 2)} 8.3{lf 5 v} |
:2 8.2{lf 4 b (0 4)} 5.1{lf 2 v} |
:4 7.3{lf 4 b (0 2)} 5.3{lf 2} :2 7.4{lf 4 v} |
:4 8.2{lf 4 b (0 4 4 0)} 5.2{lf 2} :2 7.4{lf 4 v}
